     "page": 1,
     "text": "Allen Ltd Medical Group\nRe: Darlene Steele (DOB 08/27/1972)\n\nDear Underwriter,\n\nOn January 29, 2025, I had the pleasure of seeing Darlene Steele in my practice for a follow-up visit. She presented today with concerns regarding a rash. Her blood pressure at this visit was 109/72, and she weighed 102 pounds. Darlene is a known patient with benign tumor/polyps that exhibit high-grade dysplasia, a condition that has been managed effectively over time. Additionally, she has a history of Hodgkin lymphoma, stage II, which was treated approximately 9.8 years ago, and her cancer currently controlled.\n\nOn March 1, 2024, Darlene visited my office concerning her cancer history. At that time, her blood pressure was 107/60, and she weighed 105 pounds. She reported feeling well and showed no signs of cancer recurrence at that visit. Darlene's previous visits on April 2, 2023, and May 3, 2022, were also focused on her cancer history. During these visits, her blood pressure was 115/69 and 103/61, respectively, with weights of 113 and 99 pounds. She continued to report feeling well, and her cancer remained in controlled status.\n\nOn June 2, 2021, Darlene visited for a follow-up regarding her benign tumor/polyps. At that time, her blood pressure was 114/68, and she weighed 100 pounds. Darlene has been diligent in managing her benign tumor/polyps, which exhibit high-grade dysplasia, as well as her history of Hodgkin lymphoma, stage II. \n\nRegrettably, I must mention that Darlene has been non-compliant with her medications and has missed follow-up appointments on two occasions. Despite our best efforts to encourage adherence to her treatment plan, she has not consistently followed through with prescribed medications and scheduled visits. This lack of compliance is a concerning aspect of her medical management.\n\nOn a positive note, Darlene maintains a healthy lifestyle with regard to substance use. She reports consuming approximately one alcoholic drink per week. \n\nThe details provided are intended to give a comprehensive overview of Darlene's current medical status, including her known conditions and treatment history. Please let me know if you require any additional information.\n\nSincerely,\n\nDr. Toni Martin, Oncology\nAllen Ltd Medical Group\n"
    }
